<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-10-23T07:47:20.153Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 07:47:20 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;China's coast guard continues to monitor Philippine resupply missions to the grounded vessel at Ren'ai Jiao and has shadowed a U.S. warship near a disputed shoal, while Chinese warships and a research vessel were sighted near the Bajo de Masinloc. The Philippines is deepening cooperation with Taiwan to protect undersea cables, and Taiwan has expressed openness to joint cable-protection efforts. An ex-NSA urged activation of the Philippines-China coast guard agreement, and the Philippine coast guard rescued four people on Hagonoy Island. Coast Guard personnel were killed and another wounded in a Cotabato City shooting. 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxPTU9McVh3djNpcDhfdlJmTzN0ZVIyX2F0dDRvZ1VRZzZKVVpxRG1pYTFJWjA3OEhzMmg3Umd1WnozUC1rSnRqWG9XaTZnQl9UbHl4UTZSRVpvY2YzUmlkX2FIR3NQbDU0aGljMC0wcTlfYU1jRlp2X3Z1RmdMb1NVNUxVUzhzUXFBRUhKMmFGSWtlTGlQdEFJOUpYTDRzbG5ua3FVR0hISFdQVElneEs3d2JTSVk0ay1xTi11dkJn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxOOHozWXlncm9jZTU0NmZiWUk0blJ0cHpVeDNpWm9UVUdscHU1V2MteFNUaFBVNF9tazZib0pwWDU4czUxSTZ1Wmg3WlVlMHlCLU1wYzdDaWNrdmdBT3gyOHUzY3dMbXdqTF91SURON1NLcU02bDhJdE9WaE10eW9OSXJQZzlHcFh5c2k2V1dhQ1lJa2Y3bmdMVlRYbVlqQ3NwekpLaHdvbzBud1M1Sl9DN0lRd3BFWG8zZjV3ZlNB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Internazionale&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxQV3hGbHVkdzlvRmNzS1pNS1czSkFRaVNfM1NVTGhrV3g3LWxQN3F2dVp6RVI3bXJuQklSUVVZdWxEMWh5Sl91QlF3dzJZSXMzWUVoa1pBcUZlMTN5b1FtdXBuZm42cGhhTEFsVklvLTYwc3FMU0gxbEFwM0hvVzlQTG9VdTJpQXlJY3F4SGZFbEV5VUdsajY1OGdKUnlITERUNXozYVR3YlFYWGdiSWp4WlQ0eGZkaDA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Rappler&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss